00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:35,780
When you put the bead of subfloor adhesive on the joists, drop the plywood in place and then screw it down,

253
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:42,140
what that does is it fills any of the voids and it also has a little bit of give to it.

254
00:19:42,141 --> 00:19:48,820
When the wood is expanding and contracting with the seasons, it's going to help that not squeak.

