00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:57,700
Overhead, a ceiling can be held up by a two-part polyurethane foam without the help of screws and nails.

256
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:06,280
As the adhesive is applied, it mixes and reacts, foaming to fill seams and hardening as it cures.

257
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:11,060
This is a revolutionary application that was developed for manufactured housing.

258
00:20:11,061 --> 00:20:13,320
in the late 1960s.

259
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:15,200
It allowed manufactured home builders

