00:25:24,901 --> 00:25:33,040
These, again, are being used to be able to provide a quality race car that's not going to have loose fasteners,

325
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:36,540
that's not going to have gaskets that are going to leak mid-race.

326
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:42,820
Similar considerations are just as crucial on streets and highways.

